  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.7: portrait rendering calibrated against iPhone Photos exports (15 originals, 66 exports): default focus range, better outlines and hair, less foreground blur, defined point-light and night-lamp bokeh, ISO grain; background +1.07 dB and subject about +4.3 dB PSNR against 0.6.6. Rendering 2.2-3.1x faster on one thread and 2-15x with all threads, bit-identical on x64, Native AOT and ARM64. Public API unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.6. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.7/docs/releases/release-0.6.7.md",
